<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>AGS1 Token — Future Roadmap | AEGIS Motors</title>
    <meta name="description"
        content="AGS1: Future ecosystem token for AEGIS Motors mobility platform." />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css" />
    <style>
        .token-hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(61, 142, 255, 0.1) 0%, rgba(127, 217, 255, 0.05) 100%);
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 1.5rem;
            border: 1px solid rgba(127, 217, 255, 0.3);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .coming-soon {
            background: rgba(127, 217, 255, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(127, 217, 255, 0.3);
            border-radius: 1rem;
            padding: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 2rem 0;
        }

        .token-stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
            margin: 2rem 0;
        }

        .token-stat {
            background: rgba(9, 20, 35, 0.9);
            border: 1px solid rgba(127, 217, 255, 0.2);
            border-radius: 1rem;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .token-stat-value {
            color: #7fd9ff;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .token-stat-label {
            color: #8da4bb;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .allocation-chart {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
        }

        .allocation-item {
            background: rgba(16, 37, 60, 0.6);
            border-left: 3px solid #7fd9ff;
            padding: 1rem;
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
        }

        .allocation-percent {
            color: #7fd9ff;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
        }

        .allocation-name {
            color: #c7d4e2;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .vesting-timeline {
            background: rgba(16, 37, 60, 0.4);
            border: 1px solid rgba(127, 217, 255, 0.15);
            border-radius: 1rem;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
        }

        .vesting-bar {
            background: rgba(9, 20, 35, 0.9);
            height: 30px;
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin: 1rem 0;
            border: 1px solid rgba(127, 217, 255, 0.2);
        }

        .vesting-fill {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #3d8eff, #7fd9ff);
            height: 100%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #04111d;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .token-action-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
            margin: 2rem 0;
        }

        .token-action-card {
            background: rgba(9, 20, 35, 0.9);
            border: 1px solid rgba(127, 217, 255, 0.2);
            border-radius: 1rem;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .token-action-card:hover {
            border-color: rgba(127, 217, 255, 0.5);
            background: rgba(16, 37, 60, 0.8);
        }

        .token-action-icon {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .contract-badge {
            background: rgba(61, 142, 255, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(127, 217, 255, 0.3);
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
            padding: 0.75rem;
            margin: 1rem 0;
            font-family: monospace;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #7fd9ff;
            word-break: break-all;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="page-shell">
        <!-- Navigation -->
        <nav class="navbar">
            <div class="nav-brand">⚡ AEGIS Motors</div>
            <div class="nav-links">
                <a href="/">Home</a>
                <a href="#token-info">Token Info</a>
                <a href="#allocation">Allocation</a>
                <a href="#invest">Invest</a>
            </div>
        </nav>

        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <header class="hero token-hero">
            <p class="eyebrow">Investment Opportunity</p>
            <h1>AEGIS Token</h1>
            <p class="hero-subtitle">Binance Smart Chain (BEP-20)</p>
            <p class="hero-copy">
                Invest in AEGIS Motors's global expansion. Join early backers and benefit from the future of electric
                mobility.
            </p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
                <a href="#invest" class="btn btn-primary">Invest Now</a>
                <a href="https://bscscan.com/" target="_blank" class="btn btn-secondary">View on BscScan</a>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- Token Stats -->
        <section id="token-info" class="intro">
            <h2>Token Overview</h2>

            <div class="token-stats">
                <div class="token-stat">
                    <div class="token-stat-value">1B</div>
                    <div class="token-stat-label">Total Supply</div>
                </div>
                <div class="token-stat">
                    <div class="token-stat-value">AEGIS</div>
                    <div class="token-stat-label">Token Symbol</div>
                </div>
                <div class="token-stat">
                    <div class="token-stat-value">BEP-20</div>
                    <div class="token-stat-label">Token Standard</div>
                </div>
                <div class="token-stat">
                    <div class="token-stat-value">BSC</div>
                    <div class="token-stat-label">Blockchain</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <p>
                <strong>AEGIS Token</strong> is a BEP-20 cryptocurrency on Binance Smart Chain that represents
                equity participation in AEGIS Motors's growth. Token holders participate in:
            </p>
            <ul class="feature-list">
                <li>Governance decisions for AEGIS Motors expansion</li>
                <li>Revenue sharing as the company grows</li>
                <li>Exclusive discounts on AEGIS Motors vehicles</li>
                <li>Early access to new products and features</li>
                <li>Community voting on strategic decisions</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Token Allocation -->
        <section id="allocation" class="intro">
            <h2>Token Allocation & Distribution</h2>

            <div class="allocation-chart">
                <div class="allocation-item">
                    <div class="allocation-percent">20%</div>
                    <div class="allocation-name">Early Backers</div>
                    <div style="color: #8da4bb; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 0.25rem;">200M AEGIS</div>
                </div>
                <div class="allocation-item">
                    <div class="allocation-percent">20%</div>
                    <div class="allocation-name">Seed Round</div>
                    <div style="color: #8da4bb; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 0.25rem;">200M AEGIS</div>
                </div>
                <div class="allocation-item">
                    <div class="allocation-percent">25%</div>
                    <div class="allocation-name">Public Sale</div>
                    <div style="color: #8da4bb; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 0.25rem;">250M AEGIS</div>
                </div>
                <div class="allocation-item">
                    <div class="allocation-percent">15%</div>
                    <div class="allocation-name">Team & Advisors</div>
                    <div style="color: #8da4bb; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 0.25rem;">150M AEGIS</div>
                </div>
                <div class="allocation-item">
                    <div class="allocation-percent">10%</div>
                    <div class="allocation-name">Community Rewards</div>
                    <div style="color: #8da4bb; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 0.25rem;">100M AEGIS</div>
                </div>
                <div class="allocation-item">
                    <div class="allocation-percent">10%</div>
                    <div class="allocation-name">Reserve</div>
                    <div style="color: #8da4bb; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 0.25rem;">100M AEGIS</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Vesting Schedule -->
        <section class="intro">
            <h2>Investor Vesting Schedule</h2>

            <div class="vesting-timeline">
                <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #7fd9ff;">4-Year Vesting Plan</h3>

                <div>
                    <strong style="color: #c7d4e2;">Token Generation Event (TGE) - 25% Unlocked</strong>
                    <div class="vesting-bar">
                        <div class="vesting-fill" style="width: 25%;">25%</div>
                    </div>
                    <small style="color: #8da4bb;">Tokens available immediately upon purchase</small>
                </div>

                <div style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
                    <strong style="color: #c7d4e2;">Months 1-36 - 75% Vested</strong>
                    <div class="vesting-bar">
                        <div class="vesting-fill" style="width: 75%;">75% over 3 years</div>
                    </div>
                    <small style="color: #8da4bb;">Monthly unlocking schedule</small>
                </div>

                <div
                    style="margin-top: 1.5rem; padding: 1rem; background: rgba(61, 142, 255, 0.1); border-radius: 0.5rem; border-left: 3px solid #7fd9ff;">
                    <strong style="color: #7fd9ff;">Example:</strong>
                    <p style="margin: 0.5rem 0 0; color: #c7d4e2;">
                        If you purchase 100,000 AEGIS:
                        <br />• Month 0: 25,000 tokens unlocked
                        <br />• Months 1-36: 2,083 tokens per month (~75,000 total)
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Investment Tiers -->
        <section class="intro">
            <h2>Investment Tiers</h2>

            <div class="allocation-chart">
                <div class="allocation-item" style="border-left-color: #FFD700;">
                    <div class="allocation-percent" style="color: #FFD700;">Angel</div>
                    <div class="allocation-name">100,000 AEGIS</div>
                    <div style="color: #8da4bb; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 0.5rem;">100 BNB investment</div>
                </div>
                <div class="allocation-item" style="border-left-color: #C0C0C0;">
                    <div class="allocation-percent" style="color: #C0C0C0;">Seed</div>
                    <div class="allocation-name">500,000 AEGIS</div>
                    <div style="color: #8da4bb; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 0.5rem;">500 BNB investment</div>
                </div>
                <div class="allocation-item" style="border-left-color: #CD7F32;">
                    <div class="allocation-percent" style="color: #CD7F32;">Growth</div>
                    <div class="allocation-name">1,000,000 AEGIS</div>
                    <div style="color: #8da4bb; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 0.5rem;">1,000 BNB investment</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <p style="color: #8da4bb; margin-top: 1.5rem; font-size: 0.95rem;">
                *Prices and tiers are indicative. Actual token economics will be finalized upon official launch.
            </p>
        </section>

        <!-- How to Invest -->
        <section id="invest" class="card">
            <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">How to Invest in AEGIS</h2>

            <div class="token-action-grid">
                <div class="token-action-card">
                    <div class="token-action-icon">👛</div>
                    <h3>1. Set Up Wallet</h3>
                    <p style="color: #8da4bb; margin: 0.5rem 0 0;">
                        Download MetaMask or Binance Wallet
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="token-action-card">
                    <div class="token-action-icon">💰</div>
                    <h3>2. Get BNB</h3>
                    <p style="color: #8da4bb; margin: 0.5rem 0 0;">
                        Buy BNB from exchange
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="token-action-card">
                    <div class="token-action-icon">🔗</div>
                    <h3>3. Connect to BSC</h3>
                    <p style="color: #8da4bb; margin: 0.5rem 0 0;">
                        Connect wallet to Binance Smart Chain
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="token-action-card">
                    <div class="token-action-icon">🎯</div>
                    <h3>4. Purchase AEGIS</h3>
                    <p style="color: #8da4bb; margin: 0.5rem 0 0;">
                        Use PancakeSwap or IDO platform
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <h3 style="color: #7fd9ff; margin-top: 2rem;">Purchase Links</h3>
            <p style="color: #c7d4e2; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                Once the token launches, you'll be able to purchase AEGIS from:
            </p>

            <div style="display: grid; gap: 1rem;">
                <a href="#"
                    style="display: block; padding: 1rem; background: rgba(61, 142, 255, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(127, 217, 255, 0.3); border-radius: 0.8rem; color: #7fd9ff; text-decoration: none; text-align: center; font-weight: 600; transition: all 0.3s ease;"
                    onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(61, 142, 255, 0.25)'"
                    onmouseout="this.style.background='rgba(61, 142, 255, 0.15)'">
                    🥞 Buy on PancakeSwap (Coming Soon)
                </a>
                <a href="#"
                    style="display: block; padding: 1rem; background: rgba(61, 142, 255, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(127, 217, 255, 0.3); border-radius: 0.8rem; color: #7fd9ff; text-decoration: none; text-align: center; font-weight: 600; transition: all 0.3s ease;"
                    onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(61, 142, 255, 0.25)'"
                    onmouseout="this.style.background='rgba(61, 142, 255, 0.15)'">
                    🚀 Participate in IDO (Coming Soon)
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Use of Funds -->
        <section class="intro">
            <h2>Use of Investment Funds</h2>
            <ul class="feature-list">
                <li>Manufacturing partnerships and tooling (30%)</li>
                <li>Product development and R&D (25%)</li>
                <li>Distribution network expansion (20%)</li>
                <li>Marketing and brand development (15%)</li>
                <li>Operations and team (10%)</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Disclaimer -->
        <section class="intro"
            style="background: rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.2);">
            <h2 style="color: #ffb8b8;">⚠️ Important Disclaimer</h2>
            <p style="color: #c7d4e2;">
                <strong>This is not financial or investment advice.</strong> Cryptocurrency investments carry
                significant risk.
                Token value can fluctuate dramatically or go to zero. Never invest more than you can afford to lose.
                Regulatory status varies by jurisdiction. Consult with a legal advisor before investing.
            </p>
            <p style="color: #8da4bb; margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.95rem;">
                By investing, you acknowledge these risks and that you have read and understood our full terms and
                conditions.
            </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <footer class="footer">
            <div class="footer-content">
                <div class="footer-section">
                    <h4>Token Links</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li><a href="#">Contract on BscScan</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#">View on CoinMarketCap</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#">Trade on PancakeSwap</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="footer-section">
                    <h4>Resources</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/investor-inquiry.html">Investor Info</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#">Whitepaper</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="footer-section">
                    <h4>Contact</h4>
                    <p>Email: investors@aegis-motors.com</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-bottom">
                <p>&copy; 2026 AEGIS Motors. Building the future of electric mobility.</p>
            </div>
        </footer>
    </div>

    <script src="/app.js"></script>
</body>

</html>